[en.DECISION_C08_INTERFERENCE_PROPAGANDA]
Interference in Election Propaganda

[en.DECISION_C08_INTERFERENCE_PROPAGANDA_desc]
We secretly help the Royal Cabinet and the opposition in election propaganda, while suppressing the Unity Committee and the Advisory Board in election propaganda.

[zh.DECISION_C08_INTERFERENCE_PROPAGANDA]
干涉选举宣传

[zh.DECISION_C08_INTERFERENCE_PROPAGANDA_desc]
暗中帮助皇室内阁及反对派进行选举宣传，同时压制团结委员会及顾问团的选举宣传。
